1
00:00:04,167 --> 00:00:05,250
Neutrality.

2
00:00:06,667 --> 00:00:08,292
It won't get you a statue.

3
00:00:13,375 --> 00:00:15,292
But it'll certainly help
in keeping you alive.

4
00:00:23,292 --> 00:00:24,542
I won't abandon Ciri.

5
00:00:27,417 --> 00:00:29,417
Neutrality has consequences too.

6
00:00:35,167 --> 00:00:36,083
You're right.

7
00:00:36,583 --> 00:00:37,833
I'm right.

8
00:00:37,917 --> 00:00:39,625
Well, that's deeply worrying.

9
00:00:44,167 --> 00:00:45,458
Everything that's happening…

10
00:00:47,917 --> 00:00:49,208
it's all connected.

11
00:00:50,875 --> 00:00:52,542
And she's at the center of it.

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,208
If war is coming,
there is no hiding her from it.

13
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:04,708
Are you sure about this?

14
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:06,917
Are you?

15
00:01:32,625 --> 00:01:34,958
History has a way
of repeating itself.

16
00:01:40,750 --> 00:01:44,542
The dangers we've seen foretell
an even more menacing future.

17
00:01:48,208 --> 00:01:52,583
For the first time,
I understand real fear.

18
00:02:02,042 --> 00:02:04,167
-We're witchers.
-Is that so?

19
00:02:12,542 --> 00:02:14,958
I'll never get over
how cute they look, for monsters.

20
00:02:15,042 --> 00:02:17,458
And they're like,
"No, please don't hurt me."

21
00:02:17,542 --> 00:02:18,542
And then, wham!

22
00:02:20,042 --> 00:02:20,917
Fangs.

23
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:24,250
Just, like, a boatload of fangs
all up in your business.

